<p>Notes to Unaudited Consolidated Financial Information</p>
<p>(1) In the second quarter of 1996, the company sold 194,500 shares of INSO Corp common stock.  As a result of the sale, it recorded a pre-tax gain of $8.7 million, or $5.1 million after tax.</p>
<p>(2) In the first six months of 1996, the company sold 537,500 shares of INSO Corp common stock.  As a result of the sale, the company recorded a pre-tax gain of $23.0 million, or $13.3 million after tax.</p>
<p>(3) In November 1996, INSO Corp completed a public offering of 1.2 million additional shares of common stock. The company recorded a pre-tax gain of approximately $14.9 million, or $8.6 million after tax, representing the increase in its equity ownership in the net assets of INSO.  As a result of INSO's public offering, the company's current ownership in INSO is about 27 percent.</p>
